### EsportsHub — Admin: korisnici, uloge i pregled
### Run all (⏩). Admin trazi korisnike, daje i uklanja uloge, gleda statistiku.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 0. Svjez korisnik
GET {{host}}/api/games

> {% client.global.set("aUser", "admuser" + Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000000)); %}

###
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{aUser}}", "email": "{{aUser}}@esportshub.local", "password": "lozinka123", "displayName": "Admin test" }

> {% client.global.set("aUT", response.body.token); %}

### 1. Admin login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usernameOrEmail": "admin", "password": "admin12345" }

> {% client.global.set("aTA", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Obican korisnik ne vidi admin API -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{aUT}}

### 3. Pretraga korisnika (username, ime ili email)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users?query={{aUser}}&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{aTA}}

### 4. Filter po ulozi
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users?role=REFEREE
Authorization: Bearer {{aTA}}

### 5. Daj ulogu ORGANIZER -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{aUser}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aTA}}

{ "role": "ORGANIZER" }

### 6. Ista uloga opet -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{aUser}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aTA}}

{ "role": "ORGANIZER" }

### 7. Ukloni ORGANIZER -> 200
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{aUser}}/roles/ORGANIZER
Authorization: Bearer {{aTA}}

### 8. PLAYER se ne uklanja -> 400
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{aUser}}/roles/PLAYER
Authorization: Bearer {{aTA}}

### 9. Admin ne moze ukloniti svoju admin ulogu -> 409
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/users/admin/roles/ADMIN
Authorization: Bearer {{aTA}}

### 10. Pregled
GET {{host}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{aTA}}
